re()"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Add ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/apple\/swift-log","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":"’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Logging"},{"text":" product to your app target","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to use its backend types. Any SwiftLog ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LogHandler"},{"text":" can be supplied by the factory.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Each call replaces both settings. Omitting the factory restores YubiKit’s backend;","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"omitting the level uses the selected handler’s level. Changes apply to existing sessions,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"though logs already in progress may use the previous settings.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"YubiKit’s configuration does not affect other libraries. To share your app’s backend,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"pass its factory explicitly; global ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LoggingSystem.bootstrap"},{"text":" does not select YubiKit’s backend.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Factories may run concurrently and must not log through YubiKit themselves.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Traffic-logging","type":"heading","text":"Traffic logging","level":3},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["YubiKit.Logs.configure(logLevel: .trace)"]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Raw traffic and SCP plaintext logs require ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"YubiKit to be compiled with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DEBUG"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Neither configuration nor a custom backend can enable them in other builds.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Custom connections are responsible for their own traffic l